---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kanav Bhardwaj"
  description="Personal website of Kanav Bhardwaj. Thoughts, explorations, and writing."
>
  <Header />

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>I'm Kanav</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        I am interested in <strong>understanding</strong> how things work. I am
        currently exploring topics in Physics and Mathematics.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        I enjoy exploring ideas, building things, and learning about subjects
        beyond my immediate field. This website is a place to document some of
        those explorations and share what I find interesting with the world.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is more important than ever to be able to produce knowledge and ideas
        that are not just derivative of what already exists. It is not
        immediately apparent how it can be achieved, when most things we come
        across in life are derivatives of what already exists. I am interested
        in exploring how to produce original ideas and knowledge, and how to
        make them accessible to others.
      </p>
      <p>
        Check out my blog. If you happen to care about things that I care about,
        you can follow me on Mastodon.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(48px, 9vw, 120px);
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #464c48;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #464c48;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
